{"id":"en_the-drunken-deckhand-a-hidden-legend","title":"The Drunken Deckhand: A Hidden Legend","titleEn":"The Drunken Deckhand: A Hidden Legend","description":"Eight years have passed since Sea Vanguard Jack, the mightiest warrior of his time, disappeared without a trace. He now lives in obscurity as a drunken deckhand, devoting himself to raising his daughter Mia. Everything changes when the Escort Guild is tasked with bringing the traitor Lord Parker to the capital. Pirates ambush the convoy, eager to seize his treasure map. Their attack puts Mia in grave danger, and at that moment Jack drops his disguise and reveals his godlike strength, annihilating the pirates and the monsters they command. Those wishing to follow the series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-drunken-deckhand-a-hidden-legend/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-drunken-deckhand-a-hidden-legend/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Multiple Identities","Return of the King","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dla44/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-drunken-deckhand-a-hidden-legend_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dla44/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-drunken-deckhand-a-hidden-legend_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dla44/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-drunken-deckhand-a-hidden-legend_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dla44/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false